 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1823916",
 "html": "<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1726195688138\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/b190ad85d2e0472cb48d866f0c8827b2_1726195688138_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\">Greetings, Agents. </span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">In this patch, meet two heroes with sharp claws and powerful healing factor abilities </span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">by inheriting the genes of one man.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">X-23</span>, who can use claws from both hands and feet to use various fighting styles, </span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\">has received a new Uniform and Tier-4 Advancement.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">Daken</span>, who exploits his outstanding wild senses to use claws, </span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\">has also received a new Uniform and Tier-3 Advancement.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">Agents, check out the new skills and power of the updated hero</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">by downloading the 9/18 Patch!</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><b><span style=\"color:#740060\">■ 9/18 Patch Details</span></b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">Patch Schedule: 9/19 (Thu) 3:00 (UTC+0), 9/18 (Wed) 20:00 (PDT)</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">[9/19&nbsp;(Thu) 2:54 (UTC+0), 9/18 (Wed) 19:54 (PDT) added]</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">The patch has been completed as of&nbsp;<br>\n9/19 (Thu) 2:54 (UTC+0), 9/18 (Wed) 19:54 (PDT).<br>\nPlease reconnect to the game and download the patch file.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The patch completion time may be changed depending on the circumstances </span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">and the </span><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">completion time will be announced once the patch has been completed.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The patch will be applied in waves, so the application time may vary by Agent.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The game can still be accessed during the patch.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">When the patch is complete, please restart and apply the patch for better service.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><b><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22\">▣ Two New Uniforms</span></span></b></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">Two new Uniforms, X-23 &lt;Target X&gt; and Daken &lt;Dark Wolverine&gt; have been added.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The new Uniform can be purchased after the 9/18 Patch data has been applied.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The new Uniform can be found and purchased at the Marvel Universe and the Uniform Room.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The skill effects of the new Uniforms are based on the following.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">(Tier-4 Advancement Hero: Lv. 10, Others: Lv.6)</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1726195712356\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/81a57e23d7d54f57bf23b5d8aa085cbf_1726195712356_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1726195714856\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/b7acd96fedfd4894947cc1e2de2ee5f3_1726195714856_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"color:#e67e22\">▣ X-23 Tier-4</span></b></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">X-23, the 23rd subject created by the Weapon X program, has received Tier-4 Advancement.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1726195750219\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/510a4f57d8ff428b865b94351695f1e8_1726195750219_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"color:#e67e22\">▣ Daken Tier-3</span></b></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\">Vowing revenge on his father for abandoning him, </span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\">Daken is ready to take advantage of his power of Tier-3.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1726195764421\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/b13598a6ace64ae4a0f458441edd760c_1726195764421_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1726195769028\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/7831a1c3b48b4acda5e175df8d21f0b6_1726195769028.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"color:#e67e22\">▣ New Artifact</span></b></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\">New Artifacts for X-23 and Daken have been added.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The effects are based on the 6★ Artifact passive skill Lv.4 stats.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1726195785235\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/34bfeebc64ee4a4aabc4a2022e6c9976_1726195785235_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22\">▣ Other Improvements and Changes</span></span></b></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"background:white\">1. A description&nbsp;of the option of C.T.P. of Liberation / Mighty C.T.P. of Liberation / Brilliant C.T.P. of Liberation has been changed.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"background:white\">- Before: </span></b></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"background:white\">ㆍAll damage against DESTRUCTION, JUSTICE Instinct Characters increases by N%. (N Sec.)</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"background:white\">ㆍAll damage against ORDER, CRUELTY Instinct Characters increases by N%. (N Sec.)</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"background:white\">- After: </span></b></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"background:white\">ㆍIncreases all damage dealt to all Instincts by N%. (N Sec.)</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* If you have both options (DESTRUCTION, JUSTICE / ORDER, CRUELTY) for your </span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">Normal, Mighty, and Brilliant C.T.P. of Liberation, the&nbsp;description changes to 'all Instincts' </span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">and the effect will be the same.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* This does not apply if you only have one of the two options.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22\">▣ Game Error Fixes</span></span></b></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"background:white\">1. The [Removes all Debuffs] effect now applies to herself when using the Active 3 Skill of Rescue &lt;Invincible Iron Man&gt;.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"background:white\">2. The Dialogue of ‘Prologue’ in [Library] - [Multiverse Saga (Day of the Dooms)] has been unlocked.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"background:white\">We look forward to your active participation in the events</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"background:white\">that will be held to support the growth of the updated heroes.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"background:white\">Thank you.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1726195679738\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-c